{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "08ca3de9-ac3f-82a7-952e-207d02b4366e",
  "created_at": "2026-02-09T09:06:52-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Mike Hanlon",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:02:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:02:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. [pause] I'm hoping you can help me with a fence question."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:02:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead. What are you looking to do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:02:20-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I want to put up a fence along the front of my property. It's right next to a pretty busy road, and the noise and the cars get to be a lot. I was thinking a stockade style, privacy type of thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:02:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And what's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:02:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "420 Ocean Avenue. Out on the Ocean Drive side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:02:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. What are you planning for material and height?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:02:52-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Black aluminum. About four and a half feet tall. [pause] I know stockade usually means wood, but I want the look in aluminum, the picket spacing kind of tight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:03:05-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Fine, that's a style question, not a rule. So what's your question for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:03:12-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Basically, do I need a permit for a fence? That's what I'm trying to find out before I call anybody to install it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:03:23-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally, yes. Fences usually need a permit here, and being on a busy road, there can be rules about how close to the street you can go and how tall it can be near the corner or driveway. So you'd want to apply before you build."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:03:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. [sighs] So even at four and a half feet, I'd still need one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:03:50-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I wouldn't count on the height getting you out of it. Apply and let the office tell you where you stand. It's better than putting it up and having to move it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:04:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Does it need a survey? Like, do I have to hire somebody to survey the property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:04:14-05:00",
      "duration": 28,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It can help a lot, honestly. They want to know the fence is on your land and not on the city's right of way or your neighbor's. If you've got a recent plot plan or survey from when you bought the house, that may be enough. If you don't, they might ask for one, depending on how close you're building to the line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:04:42-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think I have something from the closing. I'd have to dig it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:04:49-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Dig it out and bring it. Mark on it where the fence goes and how long the run is. A simple sketch is fine alongside it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:05:01-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And is that something I can do on the website, or do I come in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:05:09-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can come by the office at City Hall during the day, and I'd say call ahead if you want to make sure someone's at the counter who can go over the application with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:05:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Is today a bad day to come in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:05:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mondays are fine. Mornings can be busy but nothing crazy. Get there when you can."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:05:37-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. [pause] Sorry, I'm in the car, I just got parked. I'm actually kind of proud of this, I finally learned to parallel park. Took me long enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:05:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, good for you. That's a skill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:05:54-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Anyway. So, plot plan, a sketch of the fence, the material and the height. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:06:02-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Photos of the area don't hurt. And if you've picked a contractor, have their name handy. If you're doing it yourself, that's fine too, just say so on the form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:06:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll probably do it myself, or at least try. Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:06:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then you're set. Do you want to leave a number in case someone from the office needs to reach you before you come in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:06:32-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0194."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:06:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0194. Got it. And it's Mike?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:06:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mike Hanlon, yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:06:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, Mike. Come in with that paperwork and we'll sort it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:06:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Thanks for your help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:06:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Have a good one."
    }
  ],
